<title>USA: Shiloh expects to invest $17 mln in unit.</title>
<headline>Shiloh expects to invest $17 mln in unit.</headline>
<dateline>MANSFIELD, Ohio 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shiloh Industries Inc said Wednesday it expected to double the manufacturing capacity of its Greenfield Die &amp; Manufacturing Corp.</p>
<p>The expansion is scheduled to begin in late 1997 or early 1998 and is expected to cost approximately $17 million.</p>
<p>The company anticipates that the expansion will increase employment from the current 245 to approximately 300 by the end of fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>Shiloh acquired Greenfield in November 1996.</p>
